<title>JAPAN: Honma Golf up on hopes of higher profits.</title>
<headline>Honma Golf up on hopes of higher profits.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Honma Golf Co Ltd, a maker of golf-related items, rose in the over-the-counter (OTC) market on Thursday afternoon, supported by expectations that the firm's profits are likely to increase on growing exports to Asian countries, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0440 GMT, the share price was up 90 yen at 2,530 yen, after briefly reaching 2,550 yen. Volume was 29,900 shares.</p>
</text>
